# Cloudflare redirects
#
# `wrangler.jsonc` serves the repository root as static assets, so every
# folder here is also a URL. When the prototypes moved into `prototypes/`
# on 15 October 2026 their URLs moved with them, which would have broken
# every link already shared — the Mobius navigation one above all, since
# that is what the Worker is named for.
#
# These keep the old URLs working. 301, because the move is permanent.
#
# Format is one rule per line: source, destination, status. `:splat` carries
# whatever matched the `*`. Workers parses this file rather than serving it.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/

# The prototype the deployment is named for.
/Mobius-navigation       /prototypes/Mobius-navigation/index.html   301
/Mobius-navigation/      /prototypes/Mobius-navigation/index.html   301
/Mobius-navigation/*     /prototypes/Mobius-navigation/:splat       301

# The three BACS tabs. They link to each other with relative paths, so a
# visitor who lands on an old URL is redirected once and then stays inside
# `prototypes/`.
/Originators             /prototypes/Originators/index.html         301
/Originators/            /prototypes/Originators/index.html         301
/Originators/*           /prototypes/Originators/:splat             301

/BACS-import             /prototypes/BACS-import/index.html         301
/BACS-import/            /prototypes/BACS-import/index.html         301
/BACS-import/*           /prototypes/BACS-import/:splat             301

/BACS-calendar           /prototypes/BACS-calendar/index.html       301
/BACS-calendar/          /prototypes/BACS-calendar/index.html       301
/BACS-calendar/*         /prototypes/BACS-calendar/:splat           301

# Shared assets, in case an old page is still cached and asks for them.
# `prototype/` was renamed to `shared/` in the move.
/prototype/*             /prototypes/shared/:splat                  301
/calendar/*              /prototypes/calendar/:splat                301
/data/*                  /prototypes/data/:splat                    301
